variable C4${dir} equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(452.46700745765+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(452.46700745765+-452.45648512498)
variable C5${dir} equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(-697.91122304588+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(-697.91122304588+697.99468197415)
